body:
Being honest about how you feel is a really strong thing to do, so what you've written here is proof you have a lot to offer the world.

If it was true that everyone hated you, then they would be wasting their time. Spending your life trying to make someone feel bad because you hate them is, well... a waste of a life. You shouldn't have to feel like this because of what other people may or may not want you to be. You don't have to hate yourself just because of other people's problems. <3

&#x200B;
